      "segments": [
        {
          "startLine": 17119,
          "endLine": 17123,
          "text": "The  Aulak  (No.  12). — The  head-quarters  of  the  Aulak  Jats  would  appear  to  be  in  the \nAmritsar  District ;  but  they  arc  found  in  the  northern  Malwa,  as  well  as  in  the  Manjha  and  west \nof  the  Ravi.  They  are  said  to  be  of  Solar  descent,  and  their  ancestor  Aulak  lived  in  the  Manjha. \nBut  another  stoi'y  makes  their  .ancestor  one  Raja  Lui  Lak,  a  Lunar  Rajput.  They  are  related \nto  the  Sekhu  and  Deo  tribes,  with  whom  they  will  not  intermarry. "
        }
      ]
